Subject: [PATCH] Authorize selection transfers by requestor and property

Grant access only after a genuine SelectionRequest. Track the requested
property instead of recognizing toolkit-specific atom names. Permit INCR
PropertyDelete acknowledgments and revoke grants on completion, failure,
window destruction, or owner disconnect. Preserve unrelated X SECURITY checks.

--- a/Xext/security.c
+++ b/Xext/security.c
@@ -47,6 +47,26 @@

